            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                select CONVERSION_NO,
                       PRODUCT_NO,
                       BASE_UOM_NO,
                       CONVERT_UOM_NO,
                       CONVERSION_FACTOR,
                       ACTIVE_FLAG,
                       CREATED_BY,
                       CREATED_DATE,
                       UPDATED_BY,
                       UPDATED_DATE
                  from MST_UOM_CONVERSION
                  where  PRODUCT_NO = :P24_PRODUCT_NO
                ```
        }
